    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, you're able to strike with your weapons with especially brutal force. Whenever you hit with a weapon that you're proficient with and deal damage, the weapon's damage increases by an amount based on your level in this class, as shown on the Brute Bonus Damage table.</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>Fighter Level</th><th>Bonus Damage</th></tr>\n<tr><td>3rd</td><td>1d4</td></tr>\n<tr><td>10th</td><td>1d6</td></tr>\n<tr><td>16th</td><td>1d8</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20th</td><td>1d10</td></tr>\n</table>",
